iven. Probably we just need to call read_note, then produce brief using the given info.\\n\\nThus first step: call functions.read_note with city Lisbon.[tool: read_note]\"}, {\"role\": \"tool\", \"content\": \"[tool-result: read_note]\"}]" ;
